   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2022-04-01",
   "text": "Innocent Landowners Protection Act\n This bill exempts a person who has an ownership interest in a facility for oil exploration, development, production, or storage but does not participate in managing that facility from certain liability for oil spills and related pollution."
